      "Replace `appendFile` with `getCsvWriter().append()` in dev-agent.ts","Wrap all LLM calls with `getCircuitBreaker().execute()`","Initialize `getMessageBus()` in chatbot-session.ts","Register message handlers for each agent","Add `AgentOrchestrator` to user input handling","Create conversational coach sessions for advice requests","Test inter-agent messaging with sample scenarios","Add monitoring for circuit breaker trips","Update tests for new error handling paths"
