      __sera__shopping_assistant_:
        _text: "→ Sera (Shopping Assistant)"
        paragraphs[3]: "**Relationship**: Transfer partner for shopping  
**Communication**: Introduces Sera when user wants to shop", "**Transfer Triggers**:", "**Introduction Example**:"
        lists[1]{0,1,2,3}:
          "\"Find me a laptop\"","\"Compare phone prices\"","\"Where can I buy...\"","Shopping/product search queries"
      __dev__sms_parser_:
        _text: "→ Dev (SMS Parser)"
        paragraphs[2]: "**Relationship**: No direct interaction  
**Communication**: Dev works in background processing SMS; Mill logs transactions that Dev extracts", "**Note**: Users never interact with Dev directly"
