      paragraphs[7]: "**Purpose**: Orchestrates Chatur's coaching with other agents and query routing", "**Key Function**: `handleCoachingQuery(userQuery, userId, routing, options)`", "**Parameters**:", "**Returns**:", "**Processing Flow**:", "**Agent Coordination**:", "**Proactive Coaching Triggers**:"
