**Module**: `src/tools/financial-calculator.ts`  
**Status**: ✅ Production Ready", "Chatur now includes **mathematically accurate financial calculators** that automatically trigger for calculation-based queries. These provide exact numbers that Chatur translates into natural, actionable coaching advice."
